<title>USA: Anicom acquires two companies.</title>
<headline>Anicom acquires two companies.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anicom Inc said Tuesday it purchased Norfolk Wire &amp; Electronics of Virginia Beach, Va., and Western Wire &amp; Alarm of Denver for a combined price of $8.3 million in stock and cash.</p>
<p>Anicom, which sells and distributes multimedia wiring products, has now made seven acquisitions since July 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
